ustained demand persistence that marks a compounder. Operating margins are expanding by +3.9pp year-over-year, which is one of the strongest signals that the moat is deepening.","The business throws off $113M in free cash flow \u2014 roughly 3 cents on every revenue dollar, which is the owner-earnings figure that actually belongs to shareholders.","On the balance sheet, the balance sheet carries net cash, which is the gold standard: the business never has to make desperate decisions in a bad year, and thin 0.9\u00d7 interest coverage leaves no room for a bad year.","Shareholder yield is only 0.0%, a thin return of capital, and insiders hold 2.5% of the shares, and profit capture is only 0.0\u00d7 the fair share, suggesting no structural edge inside its industry."],"sector_headwinds":[{"text":"Fragmented industry with below-average profit capture \u2014 no moat to protect margins","sev":"amber","cat":"moat"},{"text":"Elevated short interest (11.4% of float) \u2014 sophisticated money is betting the other way","sev":"amber","cat":"sentiment"},{"text":"Insiders are net sellers (100% sell ratio, net $25.7M) \u2014 the people closest to the business are reducing their personal stake","sev":"amber","cat":"insider"},{"text":"Patent cliffs, drug-pricing reform, and reimbursement pressure \u2014 a single regulatory change can reset the pricing power that justifies the multiple.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"},{"text":"Clinical trial concentration risk \u2014 binary FDA outcomes on a lead asset can wipe out billions in market cap in a single session.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"},{"text":"GLP-1 disruption across sub-sectors \u2014 weight-loss drugs are reshaping demand for orthopaedics, cardiovascular devices, and sleep-apnea treatments in ways not yet priced in.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"}],"sector_tailwinds":["Trading at a 48% margin of safety to estimated fair value \u2014 a real cushion against errors in the estimate","Market is pricing in lower growth than the company has historically delivered","Trading near the bottom of its 52-week range \u2014 the market is offering a discount","Founder-led \u2014 owner alignment that often matters more than any incentive plan","Growing faster than most Healthcare peers \u2014 taking share inside the profit pool","Among the least levered in Healthcare \u2014 the fortress balance sheet in its peer set","Minimal goodwill on the balance sheet \u2014 low impairment risk","Healthcare sector showing strong relative momentum, outperforming the market by 13% over 3 months","Healthcare ETF in a sustained uptrend above its long-term average","Strong 6-month sector performance (30.7% return)"],"news_headlines":[{"title":"Alignment Healthcare (NASDAQ:ALHC) EVP Joseph Konowiecki Sells 4,930 Shares of Stock","source":"thelincolnianonline.com","link":"https://www.thelincolnianonline.com/2026/11/12/alignment-healthcare-nasdaqalhc-evp-joseph-konowiecki-sells-4930-shares-of-stock.html","date":"2026-11-13","timestamp":1794529392.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.836,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":[]},{"title":"Alignment Healthcare (ALHC) Shares Fall Amid Rising Cost Concerns","source":"finance.yahoo.com","link":"https://finance.yahoo.com/healthcare/articles/alignment-healthcare-alhc-shares-fall-172002090.html","date":"2026-11-12","timestamp":1794504002.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.904,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":[]},{"title":"Alignment Healthcare (ALHC) Raised Guidance Following Mixed Earnings, Is It 38% Undervalued?","source":"simplywall.st","link":"https://simplywall.st/stocks/us/healthcare/nasdaq-alhc/alignment-healthcare/news/alignment-healthcare-alhc-raised-guidance-following-mixed-ea","date":"2026-11-11","timestamp":1794368122.604,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.026,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":["earnings","guidance"]},{"title":"ALHC Investor Notification: Alignment Healthcare Investigated for Securities Fraud on behalf of Investors with Losses after Inflated EBITDA Lead